'''Mecha-Bun''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that is unlocked when beating [[Eldritch Forces]]. It was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] along with its [[True Form]], which increases its health and attack power, is strong against [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]] and becomes immune to Curse.

